		"name": "Foreign Exchange Rate API",
		"description": "CRUD requests for the Foreign Exchange Rate API, ordered as an end-to-end check: run the whole collection top to bottom with the Collection Runner. Change baseUrl to match your launch profile (http://localhost:5156 for the http profile, https://localhost:7029 for https, https://localhost:44317 for IIS Express). Request 10 fetches a pair from Alpha Vantage and therefore uses one of the 25 daily calls: it only reaches the provider when the pair is not stored yet. Only creating a brand new rate publishes to the exchange-rates queue, so run request 3 against a pair that has never been stored to see a message appear. Request 1 makes the collection re-runnable.",
